Memory✨ is the drumbeat of our people -- steady, patient, and eternal. It carries the stories carved by our ancestors and the lessons whispered by time itself.
To remember is to honour the path that shaped us. Our festivals, our laughter, our wounds — all live quietly inside this thread.  
Let it steady your hands and guide your steps, for no child of Ekonu walks alone.
FIND YOUR IMAGINATION🌈.
